    "body": "Requested by the user (2026-11-11): the work includes a **hardware test part** for their 770MX with the microARC 4:\n- **Stock:** 3/4\" round bar, aluminium or brass, with about 1.25-1.5\" stick-out.\n- **3+1 indexed operations,** e.g. flats at A0/A180 or a hex, and a cross-drilled hole at A90.\n- **At least one continuous 4th-axis operation,** e.g. a shallow helical groove or wrapped engraving. If continuous moves are split off, this op is refused by name for now and becomes the follow-up's test.\n- **Shallow and quick:** about 0.010-0.020\" depths, under about 15 minutes, using BT30 with ER20 tooling.\n- **Delivered:** the part, the posted .nc pinned as a golden, and a test-kit README (air-cut first, A checked block by block).",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
